      "text": "The Stonewards strive to exemplify resolve, strength and dependability.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "37" }]
    }
  ],
  "history": [
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The ancient Radiants",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "52" },
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "63" },
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "37" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "In a vision of the past, an army of Radiants from the Stonewards and Windrunners approaches.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "52" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Stonewards followed Talenelat'Elin, Stonesinew, Herald of War, and no order matched its patron more closely.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "63" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were known for dependability, strength and resolve, but were also stubborn, even when proven wrong.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "37" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The True Desolation",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "27" }]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Stoneward opens a way into a hidden room in Urithiru.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "27" }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Ideals of the Stonewards",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Ideals, also called the Immortal Words, are the rules Radiants live by. The First Ideal is shared by every order and serves as the motto of the Knights Radiant; each order then has four Ideals of its own.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "The First Ideal",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Stonewards share the First Ideal with every other order. It is broadly read as valuing life, strength and service, and the way a goal is reached.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "text": "Life before death, strength before weakness, journey before destination.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }],
              "spokenBy": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Abilities",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Stonewards use the Surges of Cohesion and Tension.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like most Radiants, Stonewards have squires.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "43" }]
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Cohesion",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "38" },
                {
                  "all": [
                    { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "38" },
                    { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "41" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Cohesion lets them reshape stone; in a vision, a Stoneward forms handholds down a cliff so Dalinar's group can escape.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "38" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "It can make stone as soft as clay or even liquid, and lets a Stoneward speak with the spren of the stone.",
              "revealedIn": [
                {
                  "all": [
                    { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "38" },
                    { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "41" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Tension",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                {
                  "all": [
                    { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                    { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "32" },
                    { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "41" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Tension lets them change how stiff an object is.",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "By controlling hardness, Stonewards can stiffen cloth into weapons or armour and walk on liquids.",
              "revealedIn": [
                {
                  "all": [
                    { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                    { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "32" },
                    { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "41" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
